<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Go on 代码无界限</title><link>https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/categories/go/</link><description>Recent content in Go on 代码无界限</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/categories/go/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>你好，世界</title><link>https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/2022/hello-world/</link><pubDate>Sun, 06 Mar 2022 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/2022/hello-world/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/2022/hello-world/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 你好，世界" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;欢迎使用 Hugo Theme Stack。这是你的第一篇文章。编辑或删除它，然后开始写作！&lt;/p&gt;
